sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Gateway as APIM Gateway
    participant Cache
    participant Policies as Policy Engine
    participant Backend as Backend API
    participant AppInsights as Application Insights

    Client->>Gateway: API Request + Subscription Key
    Gateway->>Gateway: Validate Subscription Key

    alt Invalid Key
        Gateway-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
    end

    Gateway->>Policies: Execute Inbound Policies

    Note over Policies: - Rate Limiting<br/>- IP Filtering<br/>- JWT Validation<br/>- Set Headers<br/>- Transform Request

    Policies->>Cache: Check Cache

    alt Cache Hit
        Cache-->>Policies: Return Cached Response
        Policies-->>Gateway: Cached Data
        Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK (Cached)
    else Cache Miss
        Policies->>Backend: Forward Request
        Backend-->>Policies: Backend Response

        Policies->>Policies: Execute Outbound Policies

        Note over Policies: - Transform Response<br/>- Set Headers<br/>- Cache Response

        Policies->>Cache: Store in Cache (if configured)
        Policies-->>Gateway: Processed Response
        Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK
    end

    Gateway->>AppInsights: Log Request & Response

    alt Backend Error
        Backend-->>Policies: Error Response
        Policies->>Policies: Execute On-Error Policies
        Note over Policies: - Custom Error Message<br/>- Log Error<br/>- Return Mock Response
        Policies-->>Gateway: Error Response
        Gateway-->>Client: Error Response
    end
